msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_033"
msgid "Lift key card\\n"
msgstr "カードキー\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_034"
msgid "Lift key card\\n"
msgstr "カードキー\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_035"
msgid "Picked up lift key card.\\n"
msgstr "エレベーターのカードキーを手に入れた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_036"
msgid "Lift access denied - key card needed.\\n"
msgstr "エレベーターへのアクセス拒否：\\nカードキーが必要\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_037"
msgid "Key card accepted - lift operational.\\n"
msgstr "カードキー認証ＯＫ：エレベーター作動開始\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_038"
msgid "Lift is fully operational.\\n"
msgstr "エレベーター利用可能\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_039"
msgid "Hangar has been accessed.\\n"
msgstr "格納庫エリアへ侵入した\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_040"
msgid "Met up with CI agent.\\n"
msgstr "味方のスパイと合流した\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_041"
msgid "Air intercept radar shut down.\\n"
msgstr "レーダーシステムが爆破された\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_042"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_043"
msgid "Main gate has been opened.\\n"
msgstr "メインゲートが開いた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_044"
msgid "Main gate has been closed.\\n"
msgstr "メインゲートが閉ざされた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_045"
msgid "Access denied.\\n"
msgstr "アクセスが拒否された\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_046"
msgid "Explosive has been placed.\\n"
msgstr "爆薬がセットされた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_047"
msgid "Intruder detected - security system online.\\n"
msgstr "侵入者発見　セキュリティシステム作動\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_048"
msgid "Obtain explosive.\\n"
msgstr "Obtain explosive.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_049"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_050"
msgid "Explosives\\n"
msgstr "爆薬\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_051"
msgid "Explosives\\n"
msgstr "爆薬\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_052"
msgid "Picked up explosives.\\n"
msgstr "爆薬を手に入れた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_053"
msgid "The air intercept radar is controlled from that \\nbunker.\\n"
msgstr "レーダーシステムのコントロールは\\nその地下室かしら。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_054"
msgid "There's the antenna, but... I can't throw a bug \\nthat high!\\n"
msgstr "あれがアンテナね。でも、あんなに高いと\\n投げても届かないわ…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_055"
msgid "The hangar lift is on the other side \\nof that huge door.\\n"
msgstr "格納庫エリアへのエレベーターは\\nこのメインゲートの向こうね。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_056"
msgid ""
"Careful with that trigger finger, Agent Dark - \\nyou're closing in on my "
"position.\\n"
msgstr "エージェント・ダーク、こちらジョナサンだ。\\nオレは警備兵の格好で近くにいるから\\n撃つなよ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_057"
msgid "Lift access terminals destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "エレベーターのコントロール装置が破壊された\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_058"
msgid ""
"Okay, Joanna, take a look at this. Our \\noperative inside Area 51 was able "
"to get \\nthis out to us.\\n"
msgstr "ジョアンナ。この映像はエリア５１に\\n潜入した我々のスパイが手配したものだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_059"
msgid ""
"This is your entry point... A deserted helipad \\non the edge of the "
"base.\\n"
msgstr "ここが君の侵入ポイントだ。基地の端の\\nあまり使われていないヘリポートだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_060"
msgid ""
"The lift down to the hangars and the \\nrendezvous point is beyond that "
"wall... \\nWatch out for these guards.\\n"
msgstr "この壁を突破するのだ。\\nしかし敵兵には気をつけろ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_061"
msgid ""
"Here is the communications antenna. \\nAttach a comms rider bug so we can "
"talk to \\nyou when you're inside the base. Again, \\nwatch out for "
"hostiles.\\n"
msgstr "このパラボラアンテナが\\n基地のメイン通信設備である。\\npくれぐれも敵兵には気をつけろ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_062"
msgid "Oh, my God!\\n"
msgstr "何？　これ…！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_063"
msgid ""
"Here is our friend. He appears to be \\nphysically unhurt, though he hasn't "
"\\nregained consciousness yet. By the look \\nof it, the surgeons are almost"
" done with \\ntheir preliminary tests and will begin \\ndissection soon.\\n"
msgstr "これが例の「フレンド」だ。\\n意識を失っているようだ。\\npヤツらは一通りのテストを終え\\nすぐに解剖を始めるようだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_064"
msgid "But who was...?\\n"
msgstr "でも、なぜ…？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_065"
msgid "Any questions? No. Good. Away you go to \\nthe hangar.\\n"
msgstr "質問は？　無しか、よろしい。\\nでは、急いでくれたまえ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_066"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark Mission Log, 1028 hours. Against \\nmy better judgement, I'm "
"about to enter \\nArea 51.\\n"
msgstr "１０２８ミッション記録。\\nエリア５１に侵入開始。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_067"
msgid "Agent Dark! Over here!\\n"
msgstr "エージェント・ダーク、こっちだ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_068"
msgid "There you are! I was beginning to wonder \\nif...\\n"
msgstr "あなたがジョナサン？\\n私はてっきり…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_069"
msgid "If what?\\n"
msgstr "「てっきり」どうしたって？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_070"
msgid ""
"If you'd been discovered yet. And frankly, \\nif this is how you work, I'm "
"amazed that \\nyou lasted longer than five minutes.\\n"
msgstr "あなたの正体はバレたんだと思っていたわ。\\nこんなやり方で、よく生きてこれたわね。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_071"
msgid "I was tidying up one of your loose ends.\\n"
msgstr "君のピンチを救ってやったんだぜ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_072"
msgid "My loose ends?\\n"
msgstr "私のピンチ？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_073"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I didn't realize you wanted him \\nto shoot you. I can call in "
"some more guards \\nif you like.\\n"
msgstr "そうか、君はこいつに撃たれたかったのか…\\nなんなら基地の警備兵をもっと呼ぼうか？\\n"

